          "chunk_id": "2106.09685v1-38a259c1926b-p1-sd21b4a64-g1-c0-972beeac623f",
          "source_quote": "We propose Low-Rank Adaptation, or LoRA, which freezes the pre-trained model weights and injects trainable rank decomposition matrices into each layer of the Transformer architecture, greatly reducing the number of trainable parameters for downstream tasks."
